    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36494" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξᾰγορ-άξω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>buy from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι παρά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.42.2
				</span></i>
			; <i>buy up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Crass.</u>
				2
			</span></i>; <i>buy off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικροῦ διαφόρου τὸν ἀδικηθέντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dicaearch.
					1.22
