			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῆς κατάρας τοῦ νόμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Gal.</u>
					3.13
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαγοράξεσθαι τὸν καιρόν</span>”
